# build_ipa.sh configuration.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (same folder as build_ipa.sh) and fill in what you
# need:
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is gitignored — never commit passwords or certificates.
# Values already set in the shell environment override anything here, e.g.
#     P12_PASSWORD='other' ./build_ipa.sh
#
# Signing + install are delegated to the FirmadorDeApps utility. Its .p12,
# .mobileprovision and password.txt live in FIRMADOR_DIR, so by default none of
# the values below are required.

# --- FirmadorDeApps signer (zsign + libimobiledevice) ------------------------
# Folder holding sign-app.sh, bin/zsign and the signing material.
# FIRMADOR_DIR=/Users/teo/PersonalData/Nextcloud/proyectos/Personales/2_Utilidades/FirmadorDeApps

# --- optional signing overrides ----------------------------------------------
# Override the certificate / profile FirmadorDeApps would auto-detect, and the
# .p12 password (otherwise FirmadorDeApps reads its own password.txt).
# P12=/path/to/dev.p12
# PROFILE=/path/to/dev.mobileprovision
# P12_PASSWORD=

# --- install target ----------------------------------------------------------
# Auto-install onto a specific device by UDID (default: the nearby device, if
# one is reachable over USB / Wi-Fi).
# DEVICE_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# --- paths -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where to drop the built .ipa (default: this repo's root).
# DEST=/path/to/output

# Flutter GUI project location (default: sibling repo).
# GUI_DIR=/path/to/ChameleonUltraGUI/chameleonultragui
